  "solution": "Tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy phương trình tiếp tuyến của đồ thị hàm số đã cho tại điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
